Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自人类文明伊始，娃娃便深受孩子喜爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为收藏者所珍视，以及在宗教仪式中作为连接善恶的渠道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《安娜贝尔》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(圣莫尼卡 加州  一年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.11,0:35:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(加州 帕萨迪纳)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.38,1:31:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,(六个月后)
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.71,1:34:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安娜贝尔如今被装进了一个玻璃盒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.00,1:34:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放置在艾德和洛林·华伦的艺术品收藏室内
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.00,1:34:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个月会请牧师来净化两次
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.19,1:34:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的威胁向来存在…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.00,1:34:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们提高警惕,便可加以控制，但永远无法真正将其消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光是想就让我们害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It scares us just thinking about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听了之后肯定会觉得我们疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you hear it you're gonna think we're insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚开始都是小事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It started out small,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是一只手或是一条腿 变了方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a leg or a hand was in a different position and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后是它的头朝上看 而不是向下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's head was looking up instead of down and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着有一天 就是出现在完全不同的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one day it was in a completely different room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是它自己动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's moving around by itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡米拉找了灵媒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camilla got in touch with a medium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说娃娃被一个叫安娜贝尔·希金斯的女孩附身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We learned from her that the doll was possessed by a girl named Annabelle Higgins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她失去了双亲 喜欢上了我的娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had lost her parents and had taken a liking to my doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是想做朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All she wanted was to be friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听了之后 觉得很同情她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we heard this we felt really sorry for her I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是护士 就是帮助他人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're nurses We help people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可之后…情况就变坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then... Things got worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么得到它的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you end up with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是妈妈送我的生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a gift from my mom for my birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道她是哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where she got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是…我们害怕极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... We are beyond terrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝重视牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God honour sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的牺牲会打动上帝的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And our sacrifices touch god's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感动他的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And move his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣说 这是我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus said: This is my commandment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像我爱你般爱彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you love one another as I have loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有比这更伟大的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greater love hath no-one than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为朋友舍命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That he lay down his life for his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来祷告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很高兴见到你 回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you too See you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那…谁赢了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok So eh... Who won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 不过他作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John But he cheats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？我…是以一敌二啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I Ehh. It was two against one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不得不采取措施 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to do something right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 莎朗去哪儿了？ - 我们去找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where did Sharon get off to? - We'll find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮特让你来找我的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete send you after me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说 有天他会以为我也…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear one day he thinks I'll just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一跑了之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}run off too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没了我们 他们可怎么活？说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would they be without us? I mean honestly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最后的演讲很精彩 - 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We appreciate the last speech. - Sure thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你务必代我们照顾好这位太太和宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just make sure to take care of this wife and baby for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有问过名字了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we ask about names yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 莎朗 - 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sharon! - What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是八卦 就是聊聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not prying It's just conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在琢磨呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still working on them anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们基本肯定 约翰 如果是男孩的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're pretty sure... John if it's a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女孩就叫菲丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're thinking Phyllis if it's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗？ - 是啊 你说你喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were? - Yeah You said you liked it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我可没说过 - 是我祖母的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He I never said that. - It's my grandmother's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我受不了你祖母 - 哎哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I can't stand your grandmother. - Oh dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是我 根本没人受得了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not only me I mean nobody can stand her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 她说得没错 大家都讨厌她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No she's right Everyone hates her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 说到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok Well... On that note Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们进去吧 这两位需要好好谈一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go inside These two they have a lot to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 没什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you and... - Think nothing of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住…孩子是恩赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember... children are a blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实是 然后他们学会了讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed they are. And then they learn to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你不同意叫"菲丽丝"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's a no on Phyllis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该当着他们的面聊太多宝宝的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shouldn't talk about the baby so much in front of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那样不好 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It just aint right. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们两年前才失去了女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well they only lost their daughter two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失去了女儿？米娅？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose their daughter? Mia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是离家出走 加入了嬉皮士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ran away and joined up with the hippies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在估计已经有三个老公 改名叫"星星"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By now she's probably got three husbands and calls herself Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是叫"星星"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... "Even Star"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也比菲丽丝好听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a better name than Phyllis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你…你没锁门？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... you didn't lock it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没啊 干嘛要锁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Why would I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得开始记得锁门了 约翰 现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to start locking it John I mean it's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a different world now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们自称为"家族"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call themselves "The Family".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但警方将其定性为危险的邪教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But police officials have labelled them a dangerous cult{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居住在施潘牧场内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}residing on the grounds of Spahn Ranch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里曾作为很多著名西部片的背景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once used as the backdrop for many well-known westerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"家族" 估计有将近三十名成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Family is estimated to have close to thirty gatherers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中很多都有大量药物史和犯罪行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many of them with histories of heavy drug use and criminal behaviour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前正被拘留 等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are in custody awaiting charges...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,残忍杀害泰特和拉比安卡一案的起诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the brutal Tate and LaBianca murders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们使得洛杉矶人心惶惶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They held Los Angeles in the grip of fear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在警探掌握嫌犯线索之前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before police investigators were led to the suspects...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 能关掉电视吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Honey?! Do you think you could shut off the TV?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞得我有点难以集中精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's making it a little hard to concentrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的领导者 查理斯·曼森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their leader Charles Manson was sometimes referred to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被他的追随者视为上帝和撒旦的化身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as both God and Satan by his devoted followers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并预言有"世界末日"般的事件发生 称之为"混乱游戏"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had predicted an Armageddon like event he called Helter Skelter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!{\r}
