Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据一名警探描述 这悲惨的一幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a tragic scene described by one investigator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令人联想到可怕的邪教仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as reminiscent of a horrific cult ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一对夫妻被残忍地捅死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man and his wife was brutally stabbed to death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凶手便是他们离家出走的女儿安娜贝尔·希金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by their estranged daughter Annabelle Higgins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及不明身份的男友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her unidentified boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方认为这两人是邪教成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The two are believed to be members of a cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:19:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方到达现场时 男性嫌犯已经中枪死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The male suspect was shot and killed as police arrived on scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其女儿则看似是死于自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While the daughter was found in an apparent suicide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喉咙被划开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her throat slit open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一名警员对如此血腥谋杀的总结就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One officer summed up these blood soaked murders by saying:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,工作多年 我从未见过如此可怕的景象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In all my years I have never seen anything quite as gruesome as this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,羊膜肯定没有被刺穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn well the amniotic sac wasn't punctured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也没有破裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And isn't ruptured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有受到压迫的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are seeing signs of strain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在颈部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the cervix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多半是由于外部创伤造成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most likely caused by the trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你孕期剩下的日子里都卧床休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am putting you on bed rest for the remainder of your pregnancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以起来去方便了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can get up and use the facilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你很敏感的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do so delicately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但除此之外的任何事 都会让你和你的孩子有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But anything beyond that would be putting you and your child at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you! - Ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,锁门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我让他们把每样东西都洗刷了 起码两遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had them scrub everything At least twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都可以在里面做手术 很干净的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can perform surgery in there It's so clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't have to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是不这样 卧床久了你会发疯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on bed rest for a while You'd go crazy if I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要沉迷于日间肥皂剧就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Don't get all obsessed with those daytime soaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我根本不喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't stand them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头我再把你的针线活拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bring your sewing back in later on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？我们可以把整间房变成你的血汗工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok? We can turn the whole room into your own little sweatshop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说孩子不会有事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the baby is Ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝都不知道发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The baby is not even aware of what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？因为我听说有个新的研究…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh really? Because I heard there's some new research that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也听到医生说的了 只要你听话 宝宝就不会有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the doctors. So if you listen to them the baby is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The baby is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是孩子他妈 对吗？不好的话你肯定知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're its mother right? If it wasn't you would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 如果真的出事呢？ - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if something does happen? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 会发生什么？ - 比如 我要生产的时候 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's gonna happen? - When... Like when I go into labor John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会选择保孩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll save the baby over me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别这样 - 我们得谈一下这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - We have to talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法接受宝宝有任何闪失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean I can't have it If anything ever happened to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.58,0:22:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey promise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,答应我你会保孩子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promise me you'll save the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 好 我答应你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah Yeah I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你知道吗？不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know what? It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都会好好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are gonna be fine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么声音？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.35,0:24:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.43,0:24:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.27,0:25:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你朋友 你知道的 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your friend. You know that don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是菲尔？ - 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you Phil? - Of course I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.48,0:25:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我有朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then I have a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.91,0:25:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚饭后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After dinner...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至是跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.30,0:26:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今天怎么样？ - 电视又坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd it go today? - TV went out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是房间的关系 在小屋从来没有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be that room It never did that in the den.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.18,0:26:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是什么东西啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.81,0:26:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我在商店随便买的几样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a bunch of random stuff that I picked up at the store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.00,0:26:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来给孕妇解馋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To satisfy any pregnancy cravings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.85,0:26:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思的是 我并没有想吃东西的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny I haven't really had any cravings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.41,0:26:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泡菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pickles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.72,0:26:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你知道什么最配泡菜吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My god you know what would go really well with Pickles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.25,0:26:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·戈登 我们是天生一对儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Gordon We are meant to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.08,0:26:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我知道 就像芥末和泡菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I know Like Mustard and Pickles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.11,0:27:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你今天有个很重要的会议 是吧 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you have that big meeting today? - Yeah I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他认为我很有希望留在亨廷顿纪念医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks I've got a real shot at Huntington memorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是在帕萨迪纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in Pasadena though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.29,0:27:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离海边很远 可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So further from the beach Okay with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.69,0:27:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换换风景也挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change of view would be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.09,0:27:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.44,0:27:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨克拉门托有个一天的会议 他认为我应该参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's this one day conference in Sacramento that he thinks I should attend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.45,0:27:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我朝那个方向发展有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could help move things in that direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.73,0:27:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过几天要飞过去一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly up for a day in a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就一两天？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a couple of days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.97,0:27:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得上床休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get you back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.36,0:27:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不应该坐这么久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't be sitting up this long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克拉金警探今天来电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Detective Clarkin called today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说他这星期抽空想过来一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he wanted to stop by at some point this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.93,0:27:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都已经告诉他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already told him everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.03,0:27:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我…更愿意忘记整件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I'd rather just forget the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.05,0:27:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 他只是说想再问几件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know He just said he wanted to go over a few things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.31,0:28:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.78,0:28:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得丢掉它 当时就抱在她手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get rid of it I mean she had it in her hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.61,0:28:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你是对的 你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No You're right You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.44,0:28:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就…放心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Consider it gone.{\r}
