Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.63,0:39:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.44,0:40:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 怎么会有那个的 我发誓我丢掉了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a sec How'd that get in there? I swear I threw it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.18,0:40:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.13,0:40:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是火灾之后弄混了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things must have gotten mixed up after the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.62,0:40:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Give her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.79,0:40:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.19,0:40:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你送我的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave her to me as a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.79,0:40:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佩雷斯神父说我们要相信我们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Father Perez said we should celebrate our strength right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.76,0:40:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.49,0:40:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.26,0:40:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 刚刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There She fits right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.61,0:42:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh sorry Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.31,0:42:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也住在这儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you live here too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.91,0:42:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们住在… - 别告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We live in... - Don't tell her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.99,0:42:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were not supposed to tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.93,0:42:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.43,0:42:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是很好的规矩呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a very good rule to have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.02,0:42:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的娃娃 我也有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like your doll I have one just like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.78,0:43:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.52,0:43:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实不只一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.53,0:43:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是米娅 她是丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Mia and this is Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.69,0:43:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.87,0:43:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是南… - 我说了别告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Nan... - I said don't tell her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.47,0:43:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.93,0:43:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许有天我们可以成为朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe one day we can all be friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.71,0:44:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是巴美拉的新住客 是不是 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're the new tenants at the Palmyra aren't you? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.62,0:44:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这个小家伙看什么都很新鲜吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose this little one is pretty much new to everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.09,0:44:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.42,0:44:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我…我是米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I. I'm Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.76,0:44:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊芙林 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evelyn. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.65,0:44:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 这是我女儿最喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here This is my daughters favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.90,0:44:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许等丽娅大一点 她也会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Leah will like it too when she's a little older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.85,0:44:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太有心了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very sweet Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.18,0:44:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 随时都欢迎你来 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well feel free to stop by any time. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.33,0:45:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看他们给你画了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what they drew for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.92,0:45:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到吗 是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? That's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.58,0:45:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经交到朋友了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making friends already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.59,0:45:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们锻炼锻炼身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we're getting a little exercise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.97,0:45:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.95,0:46:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要…找他们父母谈谈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we... Talk to their parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.23,0:46:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果丽娅做出这种事 我…我会想知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Leah did something like this I would wanna know about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.11,0:46:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丽娅肯定不会这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leah would never do anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.53,0:46:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,画得一点都不好 瞧瞧这比例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't even good I mean. Look at the proportions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.73,0:46:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.78,0:46:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 米娅 如果她这样 我也想知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes Mia. If she did I would wanna know too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.95,0:46:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗 所以我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? So lets go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.12,0:46:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他们住在哪儿 自我介绍一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out where they live Introduce ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.86,0:46:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不要小题大做 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let's not make a big deal outta this Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.41,0:46:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这又不是威胁什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like this is a threat or anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.94,0:46:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是小孩子过分夸张的想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just one kid with an overactive imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.24,0:46:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I... I know I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.75,0:46:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要记住 我们搬到这里是为了远离过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta remember that we moved here to get away from what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.11,0:46:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们收拾了衣服 打包了家具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We packed up our clothes We packed up our furniture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.90,0:46:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有美好的回忆 但是恐惧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We packed up the good memories. But the fears?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.05,0:46:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和焦虑？我们说好统统留在过去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the anxieties? We promised to leave those behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.87,0:46:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说起来那么容易的 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not as easy as it sounds John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.64,0:47:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我很抱歉 好吗 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. I'm sorry... Okay You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.00,0:47:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.14,0:47:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不用加班 好吗 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to work late okay so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.41,0:47:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我回家来 咱们坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say I come home We sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.34,0:47:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,享受一顿美餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a nice dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.18,0:47:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来一个…成年人之间的对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have some... Adult conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.53,0:49:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.55,0:49:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.57,0:49:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.87,0:50:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有别人在这儿 只有你我 和丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't anyone here It's just you and me and Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.74,0:50:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.59,0:50:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是她… - 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was her... - Mia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.75,0:50:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了一些事 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are things happening that I. That I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.68,0:50:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我无法解释 - 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That I can't explain. - What things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.00,0:50:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 你…你确定不是焦虑造成的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby... Are you sure they're not just manifestations of your anxiety?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.81,0:50:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新妈妈常会经历产后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's perfectly normal for new mothers to experience postpartum...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.73,0:50:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是医生 不代表你什么都是专家 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that being a doctor doesn't make you an expert on everything right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.05,0:50:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们应该找人谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should talk to someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.24,0:51:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.31,0:51:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心理医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A shrink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.94,0:51:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没疯 约翰 我没疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not crazy John I'm not crazy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.80,0:51:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说你疯了 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying that you're crazy okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的也不是心理医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not talking about a shrink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.44,0:51:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们就到教会来了 神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we turn to the church Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.42,0:51:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父母就是这样 在他们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what my parents did when they...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.23,0:51:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遇到难题的时候 并且对他们有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hit a rough patch. And it worked for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.13,0:51:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.22,0:51:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们俩遇到的并不只是一个小难题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you two hit more than just a rough patch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.30,0:51:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在几个月时间里 你们经历了人生最可怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a matter of months you've experienced the very worst of life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.19,0:51:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和最美好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the very best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.66,0:51:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此巨大的变动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pendulum swing like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.09,0:51:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足以撼动最坚实的基础\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's enough to shake even the strongest foundations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.18,0:51:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们熬过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.63,0:51:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相反于努力忘记这次不好的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And instead of trying to forget this bad history...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.68,0:51:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们应该加以利用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you should use it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.14,0:51:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为你们两个齐心协力是很强大的实例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as an example of how strong you two can be when united.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.05,0:52:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经历过这种事你们并没有变得更软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't come out the other side of something like this weaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.67,0:52:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是更坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come out stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.73,0:52:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.37,0:52:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.92,0:52:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 米娅 是吧 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mia right? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.61,0:52:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然记得丽娅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of course I remember Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.01,0:52:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.07,0:52:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 约翰 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi John. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.42,0:52:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位就是伊芙林 约翰 我跟你提起书店的那位女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Evelyn Jones. From the bookstore I was telling you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.97,0:52:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 是是 谢谢你送的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right yeah yeah... Thank you for the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我情不自禁啊 看到你家的姑娘们 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't help myself I saw your girls and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.96,0:52:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就觉得和她们相识已久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt like I had known them a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.78,0:52:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 一家三口要去哪儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So! Where's this beautiful family off to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.10,0:52:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们是… - 我得去医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh they're just... - I have to get to the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.37,0:52:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今天值夜班 - 我看是他干了坏事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They put me on the night shift. - I think he did something terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.20,0:52:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说我是得到嘉奖呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say that I'm being rewarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.28,0:52:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 如果你们想在这附近转转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. If you guys ever want a tour of the neighbourhood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.17,0:52:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请尽管打给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hesitate to call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.04,0:53:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 祝你们今天愉快 - 拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blessed day! - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.52,0:53:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也该走了 早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should probably go too Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.43,0:58:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.55,0:59:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.51,0:59:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.01,1:00:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你来见我 - 没什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you for meeting with me. - It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过接到你的电话我有点意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a little surprised to hear from you though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.61,1:00:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 上次我们讲话… - 我说我不想再知道任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Last time we spoke... - I said I didn't want to know any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.53,1:00:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持…保持了一点距离 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having... Had a little distance I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.05,1:00:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识到我需要一个…一个了结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I realize I could use some... some closure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.91,1:00:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 有太多没有解答的问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean there... there's just to many unanswered questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.98,1:00:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.27,1:00:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我带来了有关希金斯一案的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought what I have on the Higgins case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.13,1:00:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是安娜贝尔 希金斯家的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Annabelle there The Higgins girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.50,1:00:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照片显然是在她加入邪教之前拍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was clearly taken before she got caught up in the cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和你上次见到她是十分不同 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks a lot different than the last time you saw her doesn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.90,1:00:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她加入的邪教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cult that she was in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.69,1:00:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有进一步调查吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you look further into it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.14,1:00:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,具体查什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what specifically?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.02,1:00:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 他们的袭击肯定是有动机的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know There must have been some motive for their attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.36,1:01:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 疯人干疯事儿 - 疯事儿 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Crazy people do crazy things... - Crazy things I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.88,1:01:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不认为自己疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't think they were crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.95,1:01:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have to have had a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.44,1:01:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在进一步调查后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After a little more digging...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.38,1:01:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我确实发现他们的行为是有信仰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did find that their act was in devotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.18,1:01:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That they were...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.94,1:01:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们其实是想召唤什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were actually trying to conjure something up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.57,1:01:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 恶魔 魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like... Like what? - The Devil. Demons...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.29,1:01:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牙仙什么的 具体我并不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Tooth-fairy I don't know specifically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.18,1:01:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过不重要 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It doesn't really matter any. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为整件事就是骗人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well because this is all just a bunch of hocus pocus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.85,1:01:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.84,1:01:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.40,1:01:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人都是歹徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These were miscreants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.85,1:01:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道他们是嗑了什么药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were probably hopped up on god knows what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.70,1:01:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们…看到…做出各种…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it made 'em... see and do all sorts of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.13,1:02:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怕的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}terrible things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.19,1:02:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这对你来说重要吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.45,1:02:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有听过一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever heard the expression...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.72,1:02:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"有时雪茄只是雪茄"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"sometimes a cigar is just a cigar"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.25,1:02:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你不会介意我…留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you won't mind if I keep this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一张吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one for myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.70,1:02:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有件事 这个邪教有名字吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more thing Does the cult have a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们自称为"冥界使徒"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called themselves: "The Disciples of the Realm".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.27,1:03:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.62,1:03:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么我可以帮你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything I can help you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.93,1:03:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no no no I. I'm just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.03,1:03:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just browsing really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.44,1:03:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just learned something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.09,1:03:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很不会撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a terrible liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.60,1:03:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要找什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it you're looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.29,1:03:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还是改天再来吧 - 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I'll come back. - Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.85,1:03:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我岁数大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.26,1:03:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以没多少事情能吓到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means that there's very little that surprises me anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.52,1:03:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便有 我也懒得表现出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if it does I'm too tired to show it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.05,1:03:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要告诉我吗？还是我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Are you gonna tell me? Or are we just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.14,1:03:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们家在被一个…一个鬼魂纠缠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think my family is being haunted by a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.03,1:03:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第四排 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AIsle four Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.78,1:03:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道听上去很扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I know it sounds crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.31,1:03:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个女孩的鬼魂缠着我们 但是我…我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ghost of this girl haunting us. But I... I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.13,1:03:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有比分开红海更扯的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No crazier than the red sea parting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.89,1:03:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对没信仰的人来说 全都很扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To non-believers it's all crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信这种东西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in this stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.43,1:04:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.35,1:04:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子有过一两次经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had one or two experiences in my life that eh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.12,1:04:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我什么都能接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}helped me to keep an open mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.48,1:04:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不认为你所碰到的 是那个女孩的鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't particularly think what you are experiencing is the ghost of that girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.58,1:04:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.63,1:04:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼会徘徊在一些特别的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well ghosts haunts specific places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.69,1:04:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通常都发生过可怕的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Usually where something terrible has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.61,1:04:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如你们过去的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like your old house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.16,1:04:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们…搬家了 可还是会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We... We moved and it's still happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.09,1:04:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才不认为是鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why I don't think it's a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.80,1:04:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个邪教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now that cult...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.85,1:04:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他们是想召唤什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that they were trying to summon something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.67,1:04:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据我曾看到过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From what I've read in the past...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.11,1:04:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些邪教不是召唤鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These cults they don't summon ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.82,1:04:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是召唤人的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They summon in human spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.77,1:04:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肉身里从不曾存在的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that has never existed in the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.78,1:04:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.26,1:04:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要怎样呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... What do they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.21,1:05:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.58,1:05:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并且不达目的不罢休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they won't stop until they get one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.05,1:05:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该 我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I... What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.23,1:05:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望这些书中能找到答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully the answer is in one of these books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.55,1:05:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿 露比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter Ruby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.06,1:05:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在你这个岁数去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She passed away when she was about your age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.94,1:05:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.02,1:05:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失去她 我觉得生无可恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without her I felt like I had nothing else to live for so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.40,1:05:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就在我等着一切结束的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as I lay there waiting for it all to end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.92,1:05:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到她的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard her voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.51,1:05:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 我的时候未到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me that it wasn't my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.71,1:06:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝对我另有安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That God had another purpose for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.52,1:06:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也有你的安排 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too have a purpose Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To protect your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.99,1:06:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不要认为自己这样做是发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't think you're crazy for trying to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.71,1:06:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是做你认为对的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do what you think is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.18,1:06:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做你必须做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do what you have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.41,1:07:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼专门折磨软弱和脆弱之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Devil preys on the weak and the vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.49,1:07:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,企图吞噬他们的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeking to devour their souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.06,1:07:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,施展…魔咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To perform... Incantations...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.10,1:07:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洒下近亲之血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spilling the blood of kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.27,1:07:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洒下纯洁之血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spilling the blood of the innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.27,1:07:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该如何阻止？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.08,1:09:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.12,1:09:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.96,1:09:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.43,1:10:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.90,1:10:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事？你得想想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happened? You gotta help this travesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.99,1:10:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你前来 神父 - 没什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you for coming Father. - Yes. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.85,1:10:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.93,1:10:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个娃娃 我能看看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Doll May I see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.89,1:11:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 约翰丢掉过 - 或者说曾经试图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John got rid of her. - Or tried to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.51,1:11:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可她却出现在我们某个箱子的最下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she was at the bottom of one of our last boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.34,1:11:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不明白娃娃跟这个所谓的魔鬼有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't understand what the doll has to with this supposed demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.71,1:11:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔有时可以利用物体作为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demons can sometimes use objects as conduits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.76,1:11:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达到其需求目标的渠道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to achieve their desired goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.35,1:11:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需求目标？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their desired goal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.79,1:11:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的灵魂 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our souls John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.17,1:11:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以它会来找丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why it's after Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.07,1:12:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它想要她的灵魂 - 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It wants her soul. - No no no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.05,1:12:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔不能随便夺走人的灵魂 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demons can't just take souls Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.81,1:12:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂需要先献给魔鬼 才可能被其带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The soul needs to be offered to the demon before it can take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.34,1:12:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我暂时还不打算把显出我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I don't plan on offering my soul anytime soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.03,1:12:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼就是撒旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Devil is the father of lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.50,1:12:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔是他的操控者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demons are his manipulators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.94,1:12:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人会想献出自己的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one ever plans to offer their soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.35,1:12:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么摆脱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we get rid of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.45,1:12:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该如何阻止它再来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we stop it from coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.00,1:12:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前我还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.01,1:12:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但教会有人或许懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But someone at the church might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.97,1:12:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起码我听说有一对夫妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the very least I've heard of a married couple{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.98,1:12:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过去曾经和教会合作过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the church has worked with in the past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.88,1:12:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,专门处理这种事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that deal with this kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.47,1:12:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在东部 不过总可以打个电话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're back east but a call can always be placed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.03,1:12:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在此期间 我们怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do in the meantime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.83,1:12:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让丽娅再接近那个娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't have Leah anywhere near that doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.06,1:12:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把她交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.61,1:12:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许把她放在神圣的地方 会减弱恶魔的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps if she's stored in a sacred place it will weaken the demon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.32,1:12:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让它没办法再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't have the strength to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.31,1:13:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你 神父 - 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you Father. - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.51,1:14:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 你要上床睡觉 这是医嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Let's get you to bed Doctors orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.28,1:14:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 约翰 我睡不着 除非我知道它不会再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no no John I can't Not until I know it's not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.43,1:14:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 米娅 - 好了 那这样 这样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mia. - Come on What if. what if...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.30,1:14:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 约翰 我做不到 - 我来守着她怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John I can't. - What if I just stayed up with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.01,1:14:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.01,1:14:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吗？ - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alright? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.93,1:14:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.46,1:14:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.43,1:14:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.06,1:14:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for believing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.72,1:14:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你会不会信我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know if... if you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.63,1:14:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.34,1:14:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.21,1:14:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都会相信你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.40,1:14:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.37,1:14:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得佩雷斯神父会帮我们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think Father Perez is gonna help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.88,1:14:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会的 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.49,1:15:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.31,1:15:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿上帝垂怜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God have mercy on your soul!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.27,1:17:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly Mia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.61,1:17:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这与你无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's none of your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.45,1:17:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我和丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is between me and Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.29,1:17:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说她想要那套睡衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she said she wanted those pajamas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.45,1:17:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会宠坏她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna spoil her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.75,1:17:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没机会当外婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have a chance for grandkids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.06,1:17:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说孩子怎么充都不为过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides it's impossible to spoil a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.34,1:17:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我可不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if that's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.27,1:17:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对丽娅 我们就要这么想 因为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to take that up with Leah because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.69,1:17:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还指了这些裙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she also pointed out these dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.99,1:17:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊芙林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.74,1:18:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh sweetie-pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.41,1:18:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哭得越来越凶 哎哟哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh it get's crazier Oh mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.50,1:18:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.76,1:18:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的露比以前也总是闹 直到我摇晃她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Ruby used to fuzz and fuzz until I rocked her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.72,1:18:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把她放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put her down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.44,1:18:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她以前就总是哭闹 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She used to fuzz and fuzz Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.96,1:18:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.22,1:18:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 丽娅 好 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right Leah Okay Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.61,1:18:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.14,1:18:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们摇晃着宝宝一整晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gonna rock that baby all night long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.53,1:18:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是我的大救星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a lifesaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.85,1:18:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚哼唱的什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it that you were humming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.99,1:18:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个布鲁斯小调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. A little blues ditty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.38,1:18:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的露比小时候 只有听到这个才会安静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the only thing that would settle my Ruby down when she was a baby{\r}
