Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.48,1:30:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.52,1:30:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.36,1:30:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 约翰 它要她的灵魂 - 米娅 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John It wants her soul. - Mia Stop Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.49,1:30:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.53,1:30:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米娅 听他的话 你不能这么对丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia Listen to him You can't do this to Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.38,1:30:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 女儿需要她的妈妈 - 你说它需要一个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A daughter needs her mother. - You said it needs a soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.54,1:30:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过它需要一个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it needs a soul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.00,1:30:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别这样 - 请让我救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please... - Please let me save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.38,1:30:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna do this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.92,1:30:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 冷静 停下 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop stop stop! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.24,1:30:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过你会救她的 你说过你会先救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you'd save her. You said you'd save her before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.29,1:30:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你答应过的 - 想想我们的孩子 想想丽娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You promised... - Think about our baby. Think about Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.80,1:30:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？想想她 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? Think about her Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.19,1:30:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要这么对我们 - 它要她的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't do this to us! - It wants her soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.29,1:30:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 肯定有别的办法的 - 有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There has to be another way. - There is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.13,1:30:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以挽回一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.15,1:30:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是露比的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what Ruby meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.20,1:30:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh No no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.76,1:31:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝重视牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God honors sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.10,1:31:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的牺牲会打动上帝的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And our sacrifices touch Gods heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.13,1:31:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感动他的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And move his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.58,1:31:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣说 这是我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus said: This is my commandment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.00,1:31:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要像我爱你般爱彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you love one another as I have loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.91,1:31:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有比这更伟大的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greater love hath no-one but this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.56,1:31:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为朋友舍命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That he lay down his life for his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.16,1:31:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来祷告吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.81,1:32:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很精彩的布道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful sermon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.44,1:32:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你精神不错 神父 - 谢谢 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look well father! - Thank you Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.21,1:32:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在好多了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're doing much better now. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.36,1:32:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个娃娃有消息吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has there been any sign of the doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.30,1:32:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没 从那晚后就没有 我想是警察拿走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Not since that night I thought the police took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.14,1:32:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过克拉金警探那边没有记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Detective Clarkin has no record of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.32,1:32:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但邪恶时常发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But evil is constant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.00,1:32:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法毁灭根本不存在的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot destroy what was never created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.97,1:32:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望不管是谁遇到了那个娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just pray that whomever comes into contact with the doll next{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.44,1:32:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会得到他们需要的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gets the help they need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.02,1:32:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.11,1:32:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.32,1:32:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜 神父 - 拜 米娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye Father. - Bye Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.91,1:32:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.01,1:32:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮 谢谢你 神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh It's beautiful. Thank you father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.93,1:32:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝心中最美丽的杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The loveliest masterpiece at the heart of God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.41,1:32:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是一个母亲的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the love of a mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.64,1:32:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.47,1:33:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么我可以帮你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything I can help you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.21,1:33:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想找样东西送我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to find something for my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.48,1:33:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.97,1:33:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是护士 总是帮助他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a nurse. Always helping people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.81,1:33:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到处找 就想找这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We looked everywhere for one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.05,1:33:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有找到过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never did find one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.56,1:33:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是个收藏品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a collectors item supposedly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.68,1:33:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们价格定得略高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we prize it a little higher than the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.83,1:33:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要我包起来吗？ - 是的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want me to ring it up? - Yes please.{\r}
